<title>USA: Cascade sets 25 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Cascade sets 25 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Financial Corp declared a 25 percent stock dividend to shareholders of record as of May 30, 1997.</p>
<p>The payable date of the dividend is June 27, 1997.</p>
</text>
